== Documents

- Language certificate or UNSTPB foreign-language exam
- CV
- Motivation letter
- Transcript of records
- ID card
- Diplomas/awards (optional)
- GPA
- #link("https://acs.pub.ro/public/Regulament_Mobilitati_ERASMUS_2024.pdf")[UNSTPB Erasmus regulations]
- ASC contest

== Types of Mobility

- Study mobility (607/674/707), placement (2-4 months, 756/824/+250), or combined study-placement
- Short-term (5-30 days) or long-term (2-10 months)
- Travel grant and green travel grant (train, bus or shared car)

